(348556, 27722, 9232, '<td valign="top">If the title is supposed to put the viewer in mind of a body found floating (many police shows seem to refer to corpses in the water as floaters), then the composition would have had more impact if the subject were dressed for work or religious service or something other than swimming.  The artists toes in the frame also hint that this was a day at the lake as she (?) isn''t dressed to pull a corpse from the river.<br/> <br/>Good idea though.</td>', 'If the title is supposed to put the viewer in mind of a body found floating (many police shows seem to refer to corpses in the water as floaters), then the composition would have had more impact if the subject were dressed for work or religious service or something other than swimming.  The artists toes in the frame also hint that this was a day at the lake as she (?) isn''t dressed to pull a corpse from the river. Good idea though.', '2003-07-07 02:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
