(348828, 27619, 4871, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture! This is a guess, but I''m guessing that its trick photography... that''s not water coming out of the glass, its air. The glass is upside-down in water and its been tilted sideways to let the air out? Thought it fit best for the challenge and gave it a 10.</td>', 'Fantastic picture! This is a guess, but I''m guessing that its trick photography... that''s not water coming out of the glass, its air. The glass is upside-down in water and its been tilted sideways to let the air out? Thought it fit best for the challenge and gave it a 10.', '2003-07-07 09:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(348829, 27337, 92, '<td valign="top">This photo would be even better with the top  area of the building cropped off to about that stain to the guys left on the column and to just have the guy on the left in it. That would make a GREAT photo. However, this still makes me wonder :)</td>', 'This photo would be even better with the top  area of the building cropped off to about that stain to the guys left on the column and to just have the guy on the left in it. That would make a GREAT photo. However, this still makes me wonder :)', '2003-07-07 09:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
