(349793, 27695, 5964, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot and yes it makes my wonder about the story behind the image, not many do. I keep debating whether I like the photo as oof as it is, I understand why it was done like this, but yet I yearn to see the picture clearer. Good job on the lighting reflection in the bible I have a hard time on shiny surface like that. 7.</td>', 'Really cool shot and yes it makes my wonder about the story behind the image, not many do. I keep debating whether I like the photo as oof as it is, I understand why it was done like this, but yet I yearn to see the picture clearer. Good job on the lighting reflection in the bible I have a hard time on shiny surface like that. 7.', '2003-07-08 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(349794, 27652, 326, '<td valign="top">Awesome image!</td>', 'Awesome image!', '2003-07-08 01:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(349795, 27727, 6600, '<td valign="top">I might have entitled this: "Twist" of Faith (eluding to twister or tornado?).  I like the wider/shorter framing of this shot.  Not much you could do about the distracting street pole near the right side.  Good job throughout.</td>', 'I might have entitled this: "Twist" of Faith (eluding to twister or tornado?).  I like the wider/shorter framing of this shot.  Not much you could do about the distracting street pole near the right side.  Good job throughout.', '2003-07-08 01:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(349797, 27620, 6600, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast brought in by the shadows and handcuffs.  Perhaps the border could have been toned down a bit (narower and/or lighter color).  Nicely done.</td>', 'Like the contrast brought in by the shadows and handcuffs.  Perhaps the border could have been toned down a bit (narower and/or lighter color).  Nicely done.', '2003-07-08 01:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(349798, 27627, 6600, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and color (grayscale) of this shot.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I like the contrast and color (grayscale) of this shot.  Nicely done!', '2003-07-08 01:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(349800, 27711, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely done portrait.  Seems to fit the challenge.  Great job!</td>', 'Nicely done portrait.  Seems to fit the challenge.  Great job!', '2003-07-08 01:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(349858, 27667, 2079, '<td valign="top">My technical thought: This is a very clean shot. Impressive DOF, the angle, the color tone and the theme all right on target here. <br/> <br/>My artistic thought: The model is far too beautiful for this theme. She looks more like snow white sleeping than death at the end of a hard day. Her hair is too perfect to show stress, as are her perfect nails (French Manicure?) newly polished hardwood floors, show a very neat and organized life. <br/> <br/>My guess is the butler did it.   Nice work  10 <br/></td>', 'My technical thought: This is a very clean shot. Impressive DOF, the angle, the color tone and the theme all right on target here.  My artistic thought: The model is far too beautiful for this theme. She looks more like snow white sleeping than death at the end of a hard day. Her hair is too perfect to show stress, as are her perfect nails (French Manicure?) newly polished hardwood floors, show a very neat and organized life.  My guess is the butler did it.   Nice work  10 ', '2003-07-08 03:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(349866, 27694, 2079, '<td valign="top">Now Thats A Shot.  I had that same barber once. <br/>Great detail, perfect pose and expression. <br/>The left side collar is just a little over exposed for my taste showing only one small dark spot. The crop is just a bit tight on the left to me. <br/>Great work, - 10</td>', 'Now Thats A Shot.  I had that same barber once. Great detail, perfect pose and expression. The left side collar is just a little over exposed for my taste showing only one small dark spot. The crop is just a bit tight on the left to me. Great work, - 10', '2003-07-08 03:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(349869, 27466, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a classic shot. I wonder what the girls on the left are looking at, and I wonder what the girl on the right is thinking about. The long grass is a nice touch and the over-all countryish look of this is top-notch - 10</td>', 'This is a classic shot. I wonder what the girls on the left are looking at, and I wonder what the girl on the right is thinking about. The long grass is a nice touch and the over-all countryish look of this is top-notch - 10', '2003-07-08 03:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
