(350038, 27466, 9854, '<td valign="top">The mood here reminds me of Virgin Suicides. The swing carries a weight of varying emotions, nicely depicted in the girls'' body and facial language. No one seems convinced with whatever they are listening to... and the question is: what "crap" are they listening to? Nice and mildly angsty.</td>', 'The mood here reminds me of Virgin Suicides. The swing carries a weight of varying emotions, nicely depicted in the girls'' body and facial language. No one seems convinced with whatever they are listening to... and the question is: what "crap" are they listening to? Nice and mildly angsty.', '2003-07-08 10:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
