(350806, 27267, 9734, '<td valign="top">why?</td>', 'why?', '2003-07-09 03:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(350808, 27349, 9734, '<td valign="top">the photo is not 100% but theme is strike home.</td>', 'the photo is not 100% but theme is strike home.', '2003-07-09 03:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(350916, 27347, 3087, '<td valign="top">Forgive me if this offends - it''s meant in light-hearted jest.<br/>I think I know what the unanswered question is here?<br/>Missing Link between modern man and our ancestors found alive and well? <br/>(It was the hairiness that set me thinking along those lines!)<br/>Visually the light and shadow seem too bright and too dark respectively (for my tastes). Composition works very well for me though. I like the X shape that is formed with arms and legs.<br/></td>', 'Forgive me if this offends - it''s meant in light-hearted jest.I think I know what the unanswered question is here?Missing Link between modern man and our ancestors found alive and well? (It was the hairiness that set me thinking along those lines!)Visually the light and shadow seem too bright and too dark respectively (for my tastes). Composition works very well for me though. I like the X shape that is formed with arms and legs.', '2003-07-09 06:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(350918, 27619, 3087, '<td valign="top">Underwater I am assuming - I take it that''s a finger holding the base of the glass at the surface of the water and tipping it to allow the trapped air out? <br/>Great idea and wonderful colours. <br/>Not so keen on the line dissecting the lower area - perhaps better if it were a true horizontal. <br/>Lovely light in the bubbles.</td>', 'Underwater I am assuming - I take it that''s a finger holding the base of the glass at the surface of the water and tipping it to allow the trapped air out? Great idea and wonderful colours. Not so keen on the line dissecting the lower area - perhaps better if it were a true horizontal. Lovely light in the bubbles.', '2003-07-09 06:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(350919, 27386, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well captured concept - eye contact from listener really supports the theme as suggested by your title.<br/>Contrast is set too high for my preference - I am not keen on the way the facial highlights have blown out to white.</td>', 'Well captured concept - eye contact from listener really supports the theme as suggested by your title.Contrast is set too high for my preference - I am not keen on the way the facial highlights have blown out to white.', '2003-07-09 06:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(350920, 27659, 3087, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea!</td>', 'A very clever idea!', '2003-07-09 06:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(350921, 27717, 3087, '<td valign="top">An image that would stand alone and that I can picture in a gallery of related images or on an arty greetings card.<br/>Really makes me think about many things but the questions that pop up are probably different for each viewer. <br/>Both visually and conceptually interesting.</td>', 'An image that would stand alone and that I can picture in a gallery of related images or on an arty greetings card.Really makes me think about many things but the questions that pop up are probably different for each viewer. Both visually and conceptually interesting.', '2003-07-09 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(350928, 27724, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, well composed. One of my favourites this week and of course a 10!</td>', 'Beautiful photo, well composed. One of my favourites this week and of course a 10!', '2003-07-09 07:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(350929, 27466, 5728, '<td valign="top">Can''t give this one anything less than a 10! Those expressions you''ve captured are priceless.</td>', 'Can''t give this one anything less than a 10! Those expressions you''ve captured are priceless.', '2003-07-09 07:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(350982, 27289, 3540, '<td valign="top">Gimme something a little more interesting with some visual impact.  You need to Hit me more than this.</td>', 'Gimme something a little more interesting with some visual impact.  You need to Hit me more than this.', '2003-07-09 08:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(350984, 27627, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is just a little too underexposed for my tastes.  Looks like a bunch of mini hamburgers.</td>', 'This is just a little too underexposed for my tastes.  Looks like a bunch of mini hamburgers.', '2003-07-09 08:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(350999, 27490, 3540, '<td valign="top">White skies suck, don''t they?  It''s very hard to make a great picture with the sky this white.  The building is nice.  The dark part in front is a good touch of mystery.</td>', 'White skies suck, don''t they?  It''s very hard to make a great picture with the sky this white.  The building is nice.  The dark part in front is a good touch of mystery.', '2003-07-09 08:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351004, 27629, 3540, '<td valign="top">I think this one is oversharpened or someone spilled something on the blue carpet.  This happens to me with carpet sometimes too - The sharpen effect makes it look like there is glitter in the carpet.  But I could be way off too.</td>', 'I think this one is oversharpened or someone spilled something on the blue carpet.  This happens to me with carpet sometimes too - The sharpen effect makes it look like there is glitter in the carpet.  But I could be way off too.', '2003-07-09 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(351015, 27667, 3540, '<td valign="top">Here''s a question - Why is everything backwards?  I noticed that the words on the pill bottle were probably taken in a mirror.</td>', 'Here''s a question - Why is everything backwards?  I noticed that the words on the pill bottle were probably taken in a mirror.', '2003-07-09 08:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(351102, 27349, 8829, '<td valign="top">great shot and idea</td>', 'great shot and idea', '2003-07-09 10:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(351166, 27356, 9146, '<td valign="top">wish I could vote...this is a great shot</td>', 'wish I could vote...this is a great shot', '2003-07-09 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(351184, 27669, 5904, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a tad soft.  Lighting is a bit strong on the left side and could use a fill or a bounce on the right.</td>', 'Focus seems a tad soft.  Lighting is a bit strong on the left side and could use a fill or a bounce on the right.', '2003-07-09 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351212, 27619, 5904, '<td valign="top">upside down and under water... very nice effect!</td>', 'upside down and under water... very nice effect!', '2003-07-09 11:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(351425, 27096, 675, '<td valign="top">very odd</td>', 'very odd', '2003-07-09 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351429, 27535, 675, '<td valign="top">my only problem with this is the title. why did you choose to give the whole picture away.  i would have titled it something like wallcar or something that would make people make up a question of their own for the picture. as it is now, things are too obvious and take away from the impact of the photo</td>', 'my only problem with this is the title. why did you choose to give the whole picture away.  i would have titled it something like wallcar or something that would make people make up a question of their own for the picture. as it is now, things are too obvious and take away from the impact of the photo', '2003-07-09 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351441, 27361, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the dark background  and the close up.    Those eyes looks like they''ll up to something.<br/>                     Sue</td>', 'I like the dark background  and the close up.    Those eyes looks like they''ll up to something.                     Sue', '2003-07-09 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(351443, 27720, 675, '<td valign="top">god this has to be nick borton. the only conceivable person that would be at a tigers game taking photos of a crappy game</td>', 'god this has to be nick borton. the only conceivable person that would be at a tigers game taking photos of a crappy game', '2003-07-09 14:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(351490, 27466, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot is so awesome.  I assume it is "set up" (meaning you told the "models" how to look, etc.) but even so, it looks natural.  The girl on the far right, the one with the sponge bob hat makes this shot what it is.  Great work!!!!!!  10</td>', 'This shot is so awesome.  I assume it is "set up" (meaning you told the "models" how to look, etc.) but even so, it looks natural.  The girl on the far right, the one with the sponge bob hat makes this shot what it is.  Great work!!!!!!  10', '2003-07-09 15:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(351492, 27695, 811, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow depth of field.  Also leaves me wondering about the "rest of the story" which makes it an effective shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Great use of shallow depth of field.  Also leaves me wondering about the "rest of the story" which makes it an effective shot for this challenge.', '2003-07-09 15:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(351493, 27356, 811, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet effective, I think.  This shot leaves me wondering about a variety of things, so you have met the challenge well.</td>', 'So simple, yet effective, I think.  This shot leaves me wondering about a variety of things, so you have met the challenge well.', '2003-07-09 15:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(351494, 27361, 811, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine what just happened!  (Uh Oh is my 18 mos. son''s favorite phrase right now!).  It is a little too centered, I think, but I do like the expression on the face there!</td>', 'I can only imagine what just happened!  (Uh Oh is my 18 mos. son''s favorite phrase right now!).  It is a little too centered, I think, but I do like the expression on the face there!', '2003-07-09 15:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(351495, 27262, 811, '<td valign="top">very mysterious, and i like the composition and how the platform things balance each other, but it is just a touch dark, I think.</td>', 'very mysterious, and i like the composition and how the platform things balance each other, but it is just a touch dark, I think.', '2003-07-09 15:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(351503, 27626, 811, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a tv screen shot with the grain.  It does leave questions in the mind, but the overall quality of the shot is lacking some, to me.</td>', 'This almost looks like a tv screen shot with the grain.  It does leave questions in the mind, but the overall quality of the shot is lacking some, to me.', '2003-07-09 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(351504, 27609, 811, '<td valign="top">Soft focus hurts it, I think, but the water looks wonderful.  Also, doesn''t leave many questions in my mind.</td>', 'Soft focus hurts it, I think, but the water looks wonderful.  Also, doesn''t leave many questions in my mind.', '2003-07-09 15:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(351507, 27347, 8488, '<td valign="top">Clearly you meant to enter this for ''nude''? :-&gt;</td>', 'Clearly you meant to enter this for ''nude''? :->', '2003-07-09 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(351511, 27690, 8488, '<td valign="top">This really doesn''t raise any questions for me. You took a picture of someone holding their pet snake. It''s a nice enough image, but doesn''t seem to me to fit the contest much. Good lighting, though, and I like the house unsharp in the background.</td>', 'This really doesn''t raise any questions for me. You took a picture of someone holding their pet snake. It''s a nice enough image, but doesn''t seem to me to fit the contest much. Good lighting, though, and I like the house unsharp in the background.', '2003-07-09 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(351518, 27337, 811, '<td valign="top">Definitely questions.  Maybe cropping out the guy you chopped in two on the right would make it stronger photographically.</td>', 'Definitely questions.  Maybe cropping out the guy you chopped in two on the right would make it stronger photographically.', '2003-07-09 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(351530, 27721, 8488, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this doesn''t really make me think of a question. I could stretch and say it''s an answer, but there''s nothing particularly mysterious in the shot or composition. Great lighting, though.</td>', 'I''m sorry, this doesn''t really make me think of a question. I could stretch and say it''s an answer, but there''s nothing particularly mysterious in the shot or composition. Great lighting, though.', '2003-07-09 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(351531, 27586, 8488, '<td valign="top">If this weren''t so harshly postprocessed, I could rate it higher. The flat white areas and speckles on the head in particular are jarring - it makes it look like it was painted, or has a lichen growing there. Still, 7.</td>', 'If this weren''t so harshly postprocessed, I could rate it higher. The flat white areas and speckles on the head in particular are jarring - it makes it look like it was painted, or has a lichen growing there. Still, 7.', '2003-07-09 16:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(351646, 27705, 342, '<td valign="top">you are right, i have not a clue, it looks like some sort of screw in device suxch as  a loght bulb holder lying on some sort of fur.  to me, this picture is not appealing, maybe because i do not understand what it is.  i do believe it is nicley composed, but i think the light shining from the left is a bit too harsh.  - 6</td>', 'you are right, i have not a clue, it looks like some sort of screw in device suxch as  a loght bulb holder lying on some sort of fur.  to me, this picture is not appealing, maybe because i do not understand what it is.  i do believe it is nicley composed, but i think the light shining from the left is a bit too harsh.  - 6', '2003-07-09 18:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(351648, 27262, 342, '<td valign="top">this seems too dark for me and i am not sure what i am looking at, which might be the unaswered question?</td>', 'this seems too dark for me and i am not sure what i am looking at, which might be the unaswered question?', '2003-07-09 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
