(351654, 27669, 342, '<td valign="top">...because I said so...  or that is what my mom always said to me...nioce phote, good looking kid,   i like the lighting and the compostion.</td>', '...because I said so...  or that is what my mom always said to me...nioce phote, good looking kid,   i like the lighting and the compostion.', '2003-07-09 18:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
