(353879, 27611, 1005, '<td valign="top">Railroad ties?  In places the detail is pretty good, but other spots seem less clear.  Not a lot of contrast (needs more).  It needs something to say "wow, look at me!", but there''s just not much here.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Railroad ties?  In places the detail is pretty good, but other spots seem less clear.  Not a lot of contrast (needs more).  It needs something to say "wow, look at me!", but there''s just not much here.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-07-11 16:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
