(354166, 27262, 8860, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t pose any questions for me really but I really like the mildy disquieting vibe it emits. An intriguing weather condition that wouldn''t look out of place in the film ''The Fog''. Considering the gloom there''s good defintion and I like the colour. Like it. [7]</td>', 'This doesn''t pose any questions for me really but I really like the mildy disquieting vibe it emits. An intriguing weather condition that wouldn''t look out of place in the film ''The Fog''. Considering the gloom there''s good defintion and I like the colour. Like it. [7]', '2003-07-11 20:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
