(354929, 27386, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very striking image, nice skin tones, good detail. Black and white works well here, the white background is very effective. Their expressions really heighten the mild paranoia!</td>', 'Very striking image, nice skin tones, good detail. Black and white works well here, the white background is very effective. Their expressions really heighten the mild paranoia!', '2003-07-12 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(354930, 27289, 8522, '<td valign="top">Really unpleasant photo... I''m sure I won''t be the first to say so. As a photo... the focus isn''t very sharp, and it could do with a levels adjustment in Photoshop, there doesn''t seem to be enough tonal contrast. Don''t like the shadow running mid-way across. The top half of the photo looks carelessly composed. I don''t like the way the pavement cuts the picture in half. 3</td>', 'Really unpleasant photo... I''m sure I won''t be the first to say so. As a photo... the focus isn''t very sharp, and it could do with a levels adjustment in Photoshop, there doesn''t seem to be enough tonal contrast. Don''t like the shadow running mid-way across. The top half of the photo looks carelessly composed. I don''t like the way the pavement cuts the picture in half. 3', '2003-07-12 23:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
