(355208, 27667, 8586, '<td valign="top">Out of all the photos I saw this one left me wanting to know more .It show how we can''t know more.</td>', 'Out of all the photos I saw this one left me wanting to know more .It show how we can''t know more.', '2003-07-13 13:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(355234, 27267, 7778, '<td valign="top">The subject is a lil too overexposed for my liking. The ''form'' of the gravestone feels ''forced'' into the picture by the composition. <br/> <br/>Considering this wonderful find, I would have deemed it worthwhile to return here at a different time of day (or night) to observe the light and to retake the shot under more suitable conditions...<br/> <br/>Yet, an extra point for the story provided.</td>', 'The subject is a lil too overexposed for my liking. The ''form'' of the gravestone feels ''forced'' into the picture by the composition.  Considering this wonderful find, I would have deemed it worthwhile to return here at a different time of day (or night) to observe the light and to retake the shot under more suitable conditions... Yet, an extra point for the story provided.', '2003-07-13 15:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(355282, 27720, 1031, '<td valign="top">From where the catcher is reaching it could also be a grounder to third.</td>', 'From where the catcher is reaching it could also be a grounder to third.', '2003-07-13 17:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(355283, 27660, 1031, '<td valign="top">Day care center across the street from a bank?</td>', 'Day care center across the street from a bank?', '2003-07-13 17:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(355285, 27694, 7778, '<td valign="top">Wild!<br/> <br/>Wonderful, hilarious (insane?) capture/expression. The perspective (in the face!) would not be my personal preference, since it may suggest ''complicity'' on part of the photographer :-D.<br/> <br/>I''m left curious about any unrevealed gestures and/or body language that may have prompted this shot in the first place. <br/>Given the ''acute'' sense the subject communicates, I wonder if the ''light'' background sets the appropiate mood. The way it is rendered here, we''re more ''hilariously'' afflicted than frightened, which would, IMO, have increased the impact. &gt; 6<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wild! Wonderful, hilarious (insane?) capture/expression. The perspective (in the face!) would not be my personal preference, since it may suggest ''complicity'' on part of the photographer :-D. I''m left curious about any unrevealed gestures and/or body language that may have prompted this shot in the first place. Given the ''acute'' sense the subject communicates, I wonder if the ''light'' background sets the appropiate mood. The way it is rendered here, we''re more ''hilariously'' afflicted than frightened, which would, IMO, have increased the impact. > 6 ', '2003-07-13 17:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(355286, 27694, 6912, '<td valign="top">That is a real Bailey''s style! I had a look in the book and he really takes such masterpieces! Please tell me where you found a guy like that? He is so cool! 10!</td>', 'That is a real Bailey''s style! I had a look in the book and he really takes such masterpieces! Please tell me where you found a guy like that? He is so cool! 10!', '2003-07-13 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(355288, 27724, 6912, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is always very touching to see some grave stones - an everlasting unanswered question! WHY? Good work! 10</td>', 'Yes, it is always very touching to see some grave stones - an everlasting unanswered question! WHY? Good work! 10', '2003-07-13 17:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(355289, 27695, 6912, '<td valign="top">Guess what? 10! :-)</td>', 'Guess what? 10! :-)', '2003-07-13 17:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(355292, 27632, 1031, '<td valign="top">Well done, although I''d probably see how it looked with darker overall tones.</td>', 'Well done, although I''d probably see how it looked with darker overall tones.', '2003-07-13 18:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(355303, 27337, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this happens pretty frequently in my part of the country ... see my "Nightlife" entry.<br/>Also, see: <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/2402324" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.pbase.com/image/2402324/small.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.pbase.com/image/2402324/small.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.pbase.com/image/2402324/small.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Unfortunately, this happens pretty frequently in my part of the country ... see my "Nightlife" entry.Also, see: ', '2003-07-13 18:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(355341, 27726, 714, '<td valign="top">hahahahaha...this is to funny!  Great shot!! vote 9</td>', 'hahahahaha...this is to funny!  Great shot!! vote 9', '2003-07-13 20:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(355342, 27720, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Just a tad bit more light and this would be perfect. Good use of the camera settings.  Was it a home run? Vote 9</td>', 'Great shot! Just a tad bit more light and this would be perfect. Good use of the camera settings.  Was it a home run? Vote 9', '2003-07-13 20:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(355343, 27682, 714, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture.  I really like the textures.</td>', 'Wonderful picture.  I really like the textures.', '2003-07-13 20:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(355365, 27620, 8911, '<td valign="top">*laughs* Definitely leaves some unanswered questions! I like the lines of this, and the way the curves are echoed literally by their shadows on the wall and less literally by the patterns in the wallpaper.</td>', '*laughs* Definitely leaves some unanswered questions! I like the lines of this, and the way the curves are echoed literally by their shadows on the wall and less literally by the patterns in the wallpaper.', '2003-07-13 21:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(355369, 27689, 8911, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been strong enough without the title, maybe even more so - without the title leading me I suspect I''d have come up with more questions. Nicely shot, and well suited to the challenge.</td>', 'I think this would have been strong enough without the title, maybe even more so - without the title leading me I suspect I''d have come up with more questions. Nicely shot, and well suited to the challenge.', '2003-07-13 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(355370, 27667, 8911, '<td valign="top">Ouch. This one really hits you in the gut. Nicely done. I like that you chose to take it on an angle. My eye doesn''t quite know where to rest in this one, circling from the face to the arm to the bottle to the pills and back, but I think that was exactly the intent. The starkness of using black and white was a good choice for this subject, too.</td>', 'Ouch. This one really hits you in the gut. Nicely done. I like that you chose to take it on an angle. My eye doesn''t quite know where to rest in this one, circling from the face to the arm to the bottle to the pills and back, but I think that was exactly the intent. The starkness of using black and white was a good choice for this subject, too.', '2003-07-13 21:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(355371, 27679, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of perspective on this one - very attention-grabbing.</td>', 'Nice choice of perspective on this one - very attention-grabbing.', '2003-07-13 21:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(355372, 27660, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus on the door - it''s very pretty. Even out-of-focus, the security guard in the background distracts a little, though, and at least for me this didn''t really inspire questions.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus on the door - it''s very pretty. Even out-of-focus, the security guard in the background distracts a little, though, and at least for me this didn''t really inspire questions.', '2003-07-13 21:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(355373, 27466, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is nicely shot - a very attractive photo with good focus and good composition. It didn''t make me think of any questions, though. I suppose I could make some up (who are these girls? why are they here?) but the picture itself just didn''t inspire me to them.</td>', 'This is nicely shot - a very attractive photo with good focus and good composition. It didn''t make me think of any questions, though. I suppose I could make some up (who are these girls? why are they here?) but the picture itself just didn''t inspire me to them.', '2003-07-13 21:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(355374, 27490, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - I like the composition you chose, and the crisp focus. Looking up like that is very powerful.</td>', 'This is beautiful - I like the composition you chose, and the crisp focus. Looking up like that is very powerful.', '2003-07-13 21:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(355377, 27170, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is well-shot, and with that title, very funny. But it doesn''t bring any questions to mind, at least for me.</td>', 'This is well-shot, and with that title, very funny. But it doesn''t bring any questions to mind, at least for me.', '2003-07-13 21:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(355379, 27626, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject for this challenge, brings to mind lots of questions and tugs at the heartstrings. The photo being black and white makes it starker, which is also a nice touch. However - it''s also awfully grainy. It looks more like a newspaper photo from some years back, in terms of image quality, than like a digital photo.</td>', 'This is a good subject for this challenge, brings to mind lots of questions and tugs at the heartstrings. The photo being black and white makes it starker, which is also a nice touch. However - it''s also awfully grainy. It looks more like a newspaper photo from some years back, in terms of image quality, than like a digital photo.', '2003-07-13 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(355383, 27619, 2677, '<td valign="top">WOW!  I love this one!  I''m very interested about how this one was lit!  Nice air bubbles.</td>', 'WOW!  I love this one!  I''m very interested about how this one was lit!  Nice air bubbles.', '2003-07-13 21:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(355386, 27659, 8637, '<td valign="top">Neat idea...nice photo but the wires off to the right really distract.  Points though for the concept!</td>', 'Neat idea...nice photo but the wires off to the right really distract.  Points though for the concept!', '2003-07-13 21:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(355388, 27386, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and meets the challenge quite well.  Thanks</td>', 'Very nice photo and meets the challenge quite well.  Thanks', '2003-07-13 21:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(355389, 27726, 8637, '<td valign="top">Certainly has my curiosity up!  Nice idea...thanks</td>', 'Certainly has my curiosity up!  Nice idea...thanks', '2003-07-13 21:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(355423, 27261, 4793, '<td valign="top">This group seems to know where they are going! Nice shot.</td>', 'This group seems to know where they are going! Nice shot.', '2003-07-13 22:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(355431, 27356, 7969, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at your shot, I did not think much of it.  And still I think there is too much overexposure from  the light through the windows.  However, on second look I am gaining much greater appreciation.    The ''ordinary'' man, his almost devoid expression, the plainness of public transport,  speaks to me about average people.  All of us plodding along nonchalantly in life and yet we all have a mystery and a story,  thanks for the pleasure of your shot, I am glad I looked again.</td>', 'When I first looked at your shot, I did not think much of it.  And still I think there is too much overexposure from  the light through the windows.  However, on second look I am gaining much greater appreciation.    The ''ordinary'' man, his almost devoid expression, the plainness of public transport,  speaks to me about average people.  All of us plodding along nonchalantly in life and yet we all have a mystery and a story,  thanks for the pleasure of your shot, I am glad I looked again.', '2003-07-13 23:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(355446, 27356, 7778, '<td valign="top">To capture the ordinary... or<br/> <br/>to make the ordinary appear extraordinary?</td>', 'To capture the ordinary... or to make the ordinary appear extraordinary?', '2003-07-13 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(355447, 27626, 8610, '<td valign="top">Think you will get flamed for high noise level. But I like this picture. A Sharper version would be almost perfect</td>', 'Think you will get flamed for high noise level. But I like this picture. A Sharper version would be almost perfect', '2003-07-13 23:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(355448, 27698, 7778, '<td valign="top">Le title est tres jolie.  :-)</td>', 'Le title est tres jolie.  :-)', '2003-07-13 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(355454, 27726, 2199, '<td valign="top">I really like the tonal range in your photograph. I wonder if it might be more powerful with a tighter crop on the hand and bottle? Nice composition as it is, though.</td>', 'I really like the tonal range in your photograph. I wonder if it might be more powerful with a tighter crop on the hand and bottle? Nice composition as it is, though.', '2003-07-13 23:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
