(355509, 27694, 7504, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Thanks everyone!  I''m thrilled to get my first ribbon with a picture of my father!  He''s a pretty goofy-looking guy, but a super-intelligent physics prof.  Watch for his name when his fusion confinement theory is published at the end of the summer!</td>', 'Wow!  Thanks everyone!  I''m thrilled to get my first ribbon with a picture of my father!  He''s a pretty goofy-looking guy, but a super-intelligent physics prof.  Watch for his name when his fusion confinement theory is published at the end of the summer!', '2003-07-14 01:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(355510, 27619, 806, '<td valign="top">for heaven''s sake, man.. quit your day job now.. it is okay! LOL<br/>You have really become amazing... the creativity shows.<br/>congrats on another ribbon!</td>', 'for heaven''s sake, man.. quit your day job now.. it is okay! LOLYou have really become amazing... the creativity shows.congrats on another ribbon!', '2003-07-14 01:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
