(355515, 27588, 5964, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments! My original is located in my portfolio <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=28267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=28267</a>  Yes this was a pyro technics display and an amazing one at that<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-14 00:08:40.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments! My original is located in my portfolio //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=28267  Yes this was a pyro technics display and an amazing one at that', '2003-07-14 01:05:00.000000', '2003-07-14 01:08:40.000000', 0),
