(355533, 27724, 6900, '<td valign="top">YAY sher - gotta think that lonely 1 was given by a competitor or a very bitter monday 12:15am voter.</td>', 'YAY sher - gotta think that lonely 1 was given by a competitor or a very bitter monday 12:15am voter.', '2003-07-14 01:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(355534, 27535, 8911, '<td valign="top">*laughs* Ouch. Now I wish I''d voted this higher. I swear, it looked edited to me - and it''s not. Nice work.</td>', '*laughs* Ouch. Now I wish I''d voted this higher. I swear, it looked edited to me - and it''s not. Nice work.', '2003-07-14 01:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(355535, 27397, 2586, '<td valign="top">Bit surprised about some of the comments that they didn''t see the Unanswered Question. He''s an old man and he''s thinking. What U.Q, of any significance, are left for him? Probably only two: Death and What after that? <br/> <br/>I carefully recalibrated my monitor yesterday and was sorry to see that this picture was a little more flat than i intended. Since then, i increased the contrast on this portrait. This was a candid taken outdoors for which the man didn''t pose although he knew i was making pictures of him.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-14 00:31:01.</i></td>', 'Bit surprised about some of the comments that they didn''t see the Unanswered Question. He''s an old man and he''s thinking. What U.Q, of any significance, are left for him? Probably only two: Death and What after that?  I carefully recalibrated my monitor yesterday and was sorry to see that this picture was a little more flat than i intended. Since then, i increased the contrast on this portrait. This was a candid taken outdoors for which the man didn''t pose although he knew i was making pictures of him.', '2003-07-14 01:14:32.000000', '2003-07-14 01:31:01.000000', 0),
(355536, 27694, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great! This was my number one pick...congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Great! This was my number one pick...congrats on your first ribbon!', '2003-07-14 01:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
