(355546, 27386, 7350, '<td valign="top">So close, David!  You got edged out by your wife.  I guess she''s sleeping on the couch tonight!<br/> <br/>Seriously, though, this is a fantastic shot.  Composition, focus, everything is wonderful.  A 10 in my book.</td>', 'So close, David!  You got edged out by your wife.  I guess she''s sleeping on the couch tonight! Seriously, though, this is a fantastic shot.  Composition, focus, everything is wonderful.  A 10 in my book.', '2003-07-14 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
