(355677, 27349, 9332, '<td valign="top">First off, this is my first entry ever into a photo contest.<br/> <br/>Second, I used ISO 400 on purpose for the grainy look.  The more I looked at it, the more I thought that the street lights were too brightly featured.  It was not cropped, just resized for the challenged and very little contrast/brightness adjustments were made.<br/> <br/>The camera was 1" off the ground and focus locked to the distance of the #1 bullet shell.<br/> <br/>Thank you all for your comments and for a great first entry experience!</td>', 'First off, this is my first entry ever into a photo contest. Second, I used ISO 400 on purpose for the grainy look.  The more I looked at it, the more I thought that the street lights were too brightly featured.  It was not cropped, just resized for the challenged and very little contrast/brightness adjustments were made. The camera was 1" off the ground and focus locked to the distance of the #1 bullet shell. Thank you all for your comments and for a great first entry experience!', '2003-07-14 05:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
