(355843, 27170, 4793, '<td valign="top">I was touring a cattle ranch in West Virginia, when I noticed this young cow chained to the donkey, I started asking questions and learned that this was done as obedience traing for a 4-h cattle show. As I watched the duo I could see that the donkey was in absolute control. The poor cow could not get a drink of water until that donkey got thirsty! I had hoped the photo would make the viewers want to know why they were tied together, but no one asked!</td>', 'I was touring a cattle ranch in West Virginia, when I noticed this young cow chained to the donkey, I started asking questions and learned that this was done as obedience traing for a 4-h cattle show. As I watched the duo I could see that the donkey was in absolute control. The poor cow could not get a drink of water until that donkey got thirsty! I had hoped the photo would make the viewers want to know why they were tied together, but no one asked!', '2003-07-14 11:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
