(356026, 27721, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Refreshing look at the challenge.  I really like the way you have done this.  The lighting works well here.  Your focus is really good, every letter is crisp and clear.  The dof used here works well as well, you can actually see the texture in the pages as you go down through.  <br/> <br/>Definately meets the challenge.  Nicely done.</td>', '*Critique Club* Refreshing look at the challenge.  I really like the way you have done this.  The lighting works well here.  Your focus is really good, every letter is crisp and clear.  The dof used here works well as well, you can actually see the texture in the pages as you go down through.   Definately meets the challenge.  Nicely done.', '2003-07-14 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 0),
