(361620, 27170, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Your colors here are good, but your cow starts to get lost in the darkness of the trees in the background. Otherwise this is a good photo, the donkey does stand out a little more than the cow, but that is cause it is in the lead.<br/> <br/>Nice capture of trainning and yes I would have to agree it does meet the challenge cause most would ask why are the chained together.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', '*Critique Club* Your colors here are good, but your cow starts to get lost in the darkness of the trees in the background. Otherwise this is a good photo, the donkey does stand out a little more than the cow, but that is cause it is in the lead. Nice capture of trainning and yes I would have to agree it does meet the challenge cause most would ask why are the chained together. Anna', '2003-07-20 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
