(514753, 27667, 14773, '<td valign="top"><i>"My artistic thought: The model is far too beautiful for this theme. She looks more like snow white sleeping than death at the end of a hard day. Her hair is too perfect to show stress, as are her perfect nails (French Manicure?) newly polished hardwood floors, show a very neat and organized life."</i> <br/> <br/>that''s why the shot is so perfect for this challenge, there are so many questions to answer.  If it were a bum on the street who overdosed, you''d assume their life had been hard. This woman, however, poses many questions about her life. I love it. Fantastic.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-16 18:19:01.</i></td>', '"My artistic thought: The model is far too beautiful for this theme. She looks more like snow white sleeping than death at the end of a hard day. Her hair is too perfect to show stress, as are her perfect nails (French Manicure?) newly polished hardwood floors, show a very neat and organized life."  that''s why the shot is so perfect for this challenge, there are so many questions to answer.  If it were a bum on the street who overdosed, you''d assume their life had been hard. This woman, however, poses many questions about her life. I love it. Fantastic.', '2003-12-16 18:18:21.000000', '2003-12-16 18:19:01.000000', 0),
