(1204115, 27632, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  The best part is, anyone could look at this without a title and they would understand it.  So many challenge images are hard to ''get'' unless you have a personal connection to them.  The sepia adds a nice tone to this and goes along with the mood of the photo - you wouldn''t want cheery colors to interfere.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  The best part is, anyone could look at this without a title and they would understand it.  So many challenge images are hard to ''get'' unless you have a personal connection to them.  The sepia adds a nice tone to this and goes along with the mood of the photo - you wouldn''t want cheery colors to interfere.', '2005-03-02 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
